  "name": "Eye for Talent",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/perception/eye-slit-orange.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 4th level, you can assess a combatant's operational parameters with a glance. As a <strong>Bonus Action</strong>, make an Intelligence (Search) check against a creature you can see within <strong>30 feet</strong>. The DC equals <strong>8 + the creature's Challenge Rating (CR)</strong>. If you hit the creature with a weapon attack within the past minute, you add your Soldier level to this check.</p>\n<p>On a success, you learn one of the following pieces of tactical intel of your choice:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Armor Class (AC)</li>\n  <li>Highest and lowest ability score</li>\n  <li>Special senses (such as Darkvision, Blindsight, or Tremorsense)</li>\n  <li>Damage Resistances, Immunities, and Vulnerabilities</li>\n  <li>Condition Immunities</li>\n  <li>One trait, feature, or action from its stat block</li>\n</ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
